<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.persona.syncs ~ names travel to the fleet; seat claims stay local

`lares persona sync` carries every face's private label and Handle up to the persona plane of the operator's own fleet; seat claims stay local by construction. The fleet must answer: a standing vessel with an open face.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ sync

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`sync` params=`~ carry the names to the fleet`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ none

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat-or-hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat-or-hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ writes the operator's own persona plane through the standing vessel`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ the fleet did not answer; stand the vessel and unlock it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ synced

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`synced` params=`exit/0 ~ what each face's names did on the plane`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares persona sync

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares persona sync]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

